Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:30:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD reviewed-feature confirmation so completed patch
 chats close after user approval

Resolved reviews ask the user whether a patch-agent feature is complete. Local yes/no handling avoids an unnecessary backend resume, closes the ready highlight after approval, and reopens the feature when follow-up text should continue the agent conversation.
